99.9% of the time, I find myself playing Valks. When I do, I usually
find that pets get in the way, so I have the command "pettype:none" in
my defaults.nh file. The problem is, if I ever decide to play any of
the other characters that need pets to survive (Healers, for example),
I have to change the "pettype" option and change it back whenever I
want to play a Valk. I was thinking about this, and I realized it may
be possible to make a prompt so you can choose whether you want a pet
or not. You could even choose what kind of pet you want (that is, if
you are a class that gets to pick; I guess Knights are SOL on this one,
unfortunately). AFAICT, this won't break any saves/bones compatibility,
since it's basically making a prompt for the "pettype" option that's
already in the NH config file.



